    "body": "See #5016 \r\n\r\nWork remaining includes:\r\n- Delete account views should show what organizations an account will be removed from\r\n- Organizations that would be orphaned should be highlighted, as we do with packages\r\n  - *we discussed organization orphans would be based on last member, not last admin*\r\n- DeleteAccountService needs update to do the following:\r\n  - Unblock delete of organization members\r\n  - Remove deleted account from organizations\r\n  - Unlist packages should include packages orphaned due to orphaned organization\r\n\r\nAlso consider whether GDPR needs to support deletion of Organization accounts, which also have email.",
